.el .ds Aq '
.TH SPT-PROFILE 1  "profile " 
.SH NAME
profile \- Manage SSH/SSH3 tunnel profiles
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBprofile\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage SSH/SSH3 tunnel profiles
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
profile\-list(1)
List configured profiles
.TP
profile\-show(1)
Show the resolved profile (optionally redacted)
.TP
profile\-add(1)
Add a new profile
.TP
profile\-configure(1)
Interactive TUI configurator
.TP
profile\-set(1)
Set one or more `key=value` overrides
.TP
profile\-enable(1)
Enable a profile
.TP
profile\-disable(1)
Disable a profile
.TP
profile\-remove(1)
Remove a profile
.TP
profile\-test(1)
Run targeted profile tests
.TP
profile\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH EXTRA
EXAMPLES:
  spt profile add edge \-\-protocol ssh2 \-\-host gw.example \-\-user ubuntu
  spt profile configure \-\-tui \-\-name edge
  spt profile set edge keepalive.interval=30s reconnect.max_backoff=2m
  spt profile enable edge
  spt profile test edge \-\-connect\-only
